#, no-wrap
msgid "Considerations for setting up IBM Quantum Platform in an organization"
msgstr "اعتبارات لإعداد IBM Quantum Platform داخل منظمة"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Considerations for setting up IBM Quantum Platform for an organization"
msgstr "اعتبارات لإعداد IBM Quantum Platform لمنظمة"

